title: Dell PowerVault ME5: Health Alerts
agents: dell_powervault_me5
catalog: hw/storagehw/dell
license: GPLv2
distribution: Sher Zaman
description:
 Reports the unresolved health alerts of a Dell PowerVault ME5 system. Only
 alerts the array classifies as critical or warning are considered;
 informational alerts are ignored.

 The affected component, the array's description and reason, and its
 recommended action are shown in the service details for each alert, so the
 required remediation is visible without logging in to the array.

 The states for unresolved critical and warning alerts are configurable via the
 "Dell PowerVault ME5 health alerts" ruleset.

discovery:
 One service is created per array.
